  "title": "New Bags | LOEWE Unveils Fall/Winter 2026 Men's Bags: Squad Backpack, Amazona 180 Travel Bag",
  "original_title": "新包 | LOEWE 上架2026秋冬男士新包：Squad 背包，Amazona 180 旅行袋",
  "excerpt": "Loewe's Fall/Winter 2026 men's bags include the vintage-style Amazona 180 Duffle in khaki nubuck and the sporty Squad, a tote-backpack hybrid in glossy leather.",
  "author": "撰稿 X LING 编辑 X VIVI",
  "date_iso": "2026-10-03",
  "date_label": "October 03, 2026",
  "cover_image": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/d3nknqo/10a0bc9406bf87c2.jpg",
  "tags": [
