  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "LOEWE has just unveiled its men's bag lineup for Fall/Winter 2026, with the Amazona 180 collection welcoming a brand-new Duffle travel bag. Crafted in khaki-brown nubuck, it strikes a vintage, refined note, while the new Squad bag merges the roomy capacity of a tote with the carry-friendly ease of a backpack, its glossy, polished leather lending it a lively, sporty spirit.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/d3nknqo/0ae75059fd50995d.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/d3nknqo/0ae75059fd50995d.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Amazona 180 Duffle Bag ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Introduced in the Spring/Summer 2026 collection, the Amazona 180 was specially designed to mark the house's 180th anniversary. Carrying forward the original's signature rectangular silhouette, square corners and leather trim, its single handle and open-top design give the bag a relaxed, effortless feel, while the double-L emblem opens a new chapter under incoming co-creative directors Jack McCullough and Lazaro Hernandez.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "For the Fall/Winter 2026 men's collection comes the Amazona 180 Duffle, built to an oversized travel-bag scale — 48x19x32cm — making it especially well suited to short trips or business travel. The bag is made from khaki-brown nubuck, a premium top-grain calfskin that has been finely sanded to achieve a velvety, matte surface. Black calfskin detailing lends it a restrained yet sharply styled character.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
