      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Squad Backpack ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Drawing on utilitarian design, the Squad combines the generous space of a tote with the practical portability of a backpack, its roomy interior capable of holding a 13-inch laptop for standout functionality. The bag closes with a drawstring at the top, flanked by the brand's signature Flamenco knots on either side. Finished with hook closures and fabric handles, it showcases a meeting of fine leather craftsmanship and sporty elements.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
