    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Crafted from crinkled paper-textured calfskin, with the drawstring inner pocket at the top made from smooth leather, it appears casual yet is in fact exquisitely made. It comes in two versions — lemon yellow and black. The lemon yellow is bright and eye-catching, exuding a sunny, sporty air, while the black is more understated and versatile, ready to serve as an everyday staple in any bag collection.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
